# What does NOT go in the VSIX. `images/` is absent on purpose: the PNG has to
# ship, or the Marketplace listing has no tile. Only the PNG, though. The SVG it
# is rendered from is source, and nothing in the package can read it: vsce
# refuses an SVG icon, and the Marketplace strips one out of the README.
images/*.svg
.vscode/**
.vscode-dev/**
.github/**
.githooks/**
src/**
sample/**
docs/**
scripts/**
out/test/**
out/**/*.map
node_modules/**
tsconfig.json
package-lock.json
.gitignore
.gitattributes
CLAUDE.md
*.vsix
